  "urai": null,
  "english": "A modest wife like a javelin in the hand of a hero As the scroll that he reads, whose inmost heart well understands it, is goodly wealth with him who is graced by a generous spirit. As a keen weapon in the hand of a clear-souled hero, is the loveliness that a modest woman owns.",
